@startuml
title ReLink Current System Architecture

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Initiator\nClient A" as ClientA
actor "Receiver\nClient B" as ClientB
cloud "Out-of-band share\nQR code / deep link" as OOB
cloud "Public Internet / NAT" as Net
cloud "coturn\nSTUN only\n:3478" as Stun

rectangle "Client Device A" {
  component "Flutter UI\nInitiatorPage" as InitiatorUi
  component "ConnectionService" as ConnSvcA
  component "WebRTCManager" as WebRtcA
  component "Local Crypto\nFRB + shared::connection" as CryptoA
}

rectangle "Client Device B" {
  component "Flutter UI\nResponderPage" as ResponderUi
  component "ConnectionService" as ConnSvcB
  component "WebRTCManager" as WebRtcB
  component "Local Crypto\nFRB + shared::connection" as CryptoB
}

node "Edge / Server Infrastructure" {
  component "Caddy Edge Gateway\nHTTPS + WSS reverse proxy" as Caddy

  node "Rust Signaling Server" {
    component "Axum Router + Handlers\n/connection/init\n/connection/join\n/connection/send\n/connection/recv\n/connection/close\n/ws/:mailbox_id" as Axum
    component "RendezvousService" as Rendezvous
    component "PushHub\nin-memory mailbox fan-out" as PushHub
  }

  database "Redis\nsig:rendezvous:{token}\nsig:mailbox_meta:{id}\nsig:mailbox_msgs:{id}" as Redis
}

ClientA --> InitiatorUi
ClientB --> ResponderUi

InitiatorUi --> ConnSvcA
InitiatorUi --> WebRtcA
InitiatorUi --> CryptoA

ResponderUi --> ConnSvcB
ResponderUi --> WebRtcB
ResponderUi --> CryptoB

InitiatorUi --> OOB : share link
OOB --> ResponderUi : token + secret

ConnSvcA --> Caddy : HTTPS / WSS
ConnSvcB --> Caddy : HTTPS / WSS
Caddy --> Axum : reverse proxy

Axum --> Rendezvous : init / join / send / close
Axum --> PushHub : WS subscribe + notify
Rendezvous --> Redis : TTL-backed reads / writes

PushHub --> Axum : broadcast mailbox events
Axum --> ConnSvcA : WS push + history sync
Axum --> ConnSvcB : WS push + history sync

WebRtcA --> Stun : ICE candidate gathering
WebRtcB --> Stun : ICE candidate gathering
WebRtcA <--> WebRtcB : DTLS / SRTP / SCTP\nDirect P2P session

note bottom of Axum
Current active flow is blind rendezvous.
`POST /connection/init` goes directly to
`RendezvousService::init_connection`.
No session verification is performed in this path.
end note

note bottom of Stun
`docker-compose.yml` starts coturn with `--stun-only`.
No TURN relay is configured in the default stack.
end note

note bottom of PushHub
Mailbox subscriptions use `GET /ws/:mailbox_id`.
`ConnectionService.subscribeMailbox()` also calls
`POST /connection/recv` to backfill missed messages.
end note

@enduml
